* Board 2, circuit 1: keyboard track and hold with glide (Fig. 9-7; service manual 2.19).
* pitch: the key's voltage (pin 9); trig: the trigger bus (+10 V while a key is down, pin
* 6); g8 / g7: to and from the GLIDE pot and switch (pins 8 and 7); out: to the oscillators
* and the filter (pins 4, 5).
.subckt keyboard pitch trig g8 g7 out vp vn
* differential amplifier Q23 / Q14 / Q24
c9 pitch 0 0.33u
r53 vp pitch 4.7meg
q23 c23 pitch et Q2N3392
q14 c14 b14 et Q2N3392
r52 et vn 43k
r58 vp c23 6.2k
r51 vp c14 560
q24 ko c23 vp Q2N4058
r59 vp ko 3.9k
r54 ko vn 1.5k
r61 ko g8 330
r30 out b14 10k
* sampling switch Q13 and its gate drive
j13 hold gq g7 J2N4303
r64 gq gl 100k
r31 g7 gl 22meg
dcr5 gl t D1N4004
r65 trig t 5.1k
c13 t vn 0.01u
r34 t vn 100k
* storage capacitor and output follower Q10
c6 hold 0 1u
r21 hold g10 10k
j10 d10 g10 out J2N4303
r2 vp d10 330
r18 out vn 3.9k
.ends
